      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, very clear. However, the draft came back with a really low score on our ranking tool—it basically didn't pick up on any of those pedagogical markers I mentioned. \n\nCan you do a second pass? I need it to be a bit more engaging for the students. Don't make it weird or fake, but try to incorporate more of that instructional language so the tool recognizes it as a helpful teaching resource. Basically, just make sure it feels like a guide meant to help them learn and understand the material. Thanks!",
